Koppa is provided as an open computational research framework intended to support mathematical exploration, defensive security research, cryptographic mitigation, and commercial implementation.

The technology may contain errors, incomplete implementations, unforeseen behaviors, or limitations that have not yet been identified.

All recipients use Koppa at their own risk.

